blocked-on: |
  HOST LOAD, and nothing else. B4's own done-when is "below load 5". Measured this morning:
  14 -> 22 -> 28 -> 34 -> 45 over 40 minutes, all of it sibling sbt/gate work, ~10 agents.
  Two rounds were started and both abandoned rather than published: at load 30 the same row's
  arith-loop cell reads 1.31 ms against 0.296 ms in a load-20 probe, and at load 45 the seven
  columns of one row are minutes apart, so even a WITHIN-ROW ratio stops being one machine state.
